.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "2026-09-23" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words and characters of a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "myfilefunctions.h"

int wordCount(FILE* file, int* lines, int* words, int* chars);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads the open stream file until end of file and stores the number of lines, words and characters in the integers pointed to by lines, words and chars. Returns 0 on success and -1 on failure.
